# 基线路线（golden.py）：出南门进血腥荒野，点怪打几下（触屏点怪 = 走过去攻击），停手后存盘。战斗走服务端的随机数，回放逐拍相同说明种子、时钟与命令包都对得上
# Baseline route (golden.py): out of the south gate into the Blood Moor, tap monsters a few times (a touch tap on a monster = walk over and attack), then stop and save. Combat uses the server's random numbers, so a tick-identical replay means the seed, clock and packets all line up
name golden_fight
save warlock
env DM_GAME_SEED=305419896
timeout 240

enter_game
sleep 2
walk_to 5789 4495 timeout=20
walk_to 5791 4523 timeout=25
expect_state area=2 timeout=10
walk_to 5791 4560 timeout=25
walk_to 5791 4600 timeout=25
tap_unit 1 any timeout=20
sleep 2
tap_unit 1 any timeout=20
sleep 2
tap_unit 1 any timeout=20
sleep 3
save_now timeout=8
sleep 1
quit
check no_red
